+// Minimum free heap (bytes) required before attempting the HTTPS/TLS fetch.
+// WiFiClientSecure's TLS session needs a large contiguous allocation; on a
+// loaded ESP32 running the rest of this firmware, attempting it with too
+// little headroom risks a crash. IMPORTANT: the watchdog is intentionally
+// left ENABLED during this whole flow (unlike the firmware OTA task) so
+// that any hang here still self-recovers with a reboot instead of requiring
+// a physical power cycle - this device may not have physical access.
+#define ICON_INSTALL_MIN_HEAP 60000
+
